# What goes into the image build. The rule is "nothing, except what is named": a new file or folder
# (a .env with a password, test data, notes) can never get in by accident. Rules are read in order and
# a later one wins, which is why the tests are left out again at the end.

*

# The install step needs the manifests and the lock file (the lock file covers the whole workspace).
!package.json
!bun.lock
!apps/api/package.json
!apps/web/package.json

# What the API runs: its source and its migrations.
!apps/api/src
!apps/api/drizzle

# ...but not its tests or their helpers.
**/__tests__
**/test-support
**/*.test.ts
